			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration for compact output\n\nReformat ESBuild configuration files to use more compact single-line expressions where appropriate, following patterns established in recent style commits.\n\nChanges:\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js: Collapse __name call to single line, compact nested import/merge structure\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js: Collapse On boolean expression to single line, compact plugin setup\n- Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js: Minor catch block reformatting, adjust On expression\n- Rebuild all target files to reflect configuration formatting changes\n\nNo functional changes, purely formatting adjustments for consistency with previous style commits.",
