			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration files for consistency\n\nExpand multi-line formatting in Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js and Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js to improve readability. Apply the same formatting pattern to Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js for consistency between source and generated outputs.\n\nChanges include:\n- Breaking the __name function call across multiple lines in Target.js\n- Expanding boolean expressions (On, Clean) to multi-line format\n- Adjusting import statements and object properties to multi-line\n\nRebuilt all target files to reflect configuration formatting changes:\n- Target/Worker.js\n- Target/Worker/CSS/Load.js\n- Target/Worker/Policy.js\n- Target/Worker/Register.js\n\nNo functional changes.",
